# GitHub's source archives are `git archive` output and honour export-ignore.
# Home Assistant's Marketplace (2026.11+) refuses an archive that expands past
# 100 MiB, and the committed APK build outputs in android/apk/ alone are ~493 MB.
# They are Android release artefacts, never read by the integration at runtime.
# They stay in the repository and in clones; only archive exports omit them.
android/apk/   export-ignore
android/apk/** export-ignore
*.apk         export-ignore
